arrowbench
----------

inst/tasks/tpch_*.R contain the TPC-H-derived queries of R/tpch-queries.R in
arrowbench at commit deacdebc64:

    https://github.com/voltrondata-labs/arrowbench

The queries were changed to refer to tables by name, to use the |> pipe, and
to call lubridate::year(). arrowbench is licensed under the MIT license:

