TPC-H
-----

The tpch tasks are derived from the TPC-H specification of the Transaction
Processing Performance Council (https://www.tpc.org/tpch/). They are not the
TPC-H benchmark, and their results are not comparable with published TPC-H
results. The TPC-H data is generated by DuckDB's tpch extension
(https://duckdb.org, MIT).
